            "text": "People visit the website."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "They see what the business does."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "They check prices."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "They order things from the website, too."
          },
          {
            "id": "s13",
            "text": "Businesses want to have a nice website."
          },
          {
            "id": "s14",
            "text": "So they need a good web designer."
          }
        ]
      }
